																								<script type="text/javascript">
							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"713414124781962475","clan_steamid":"103582791475507598","event_name":"One Month in Gildenarch","event_type":28,"appid":4317690,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1790971140,"rtime32_end_time":1790974740,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"A Letter From Team Metal\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"2f277c6e29ea1fe845351fadf448dcba7fee71a5.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"88ae00a54abca8a62ec1fcc015736d2f4064028b.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"713414124781962476","clanid":"45986190","posterid":"0","headline":"One Month in Gildenarch","posttime":1790971195,"updatetime":1790971195,"body":"[p]Nephilim,\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]It\u2019s been one month since we launched Crimson Moon, and I wanted to take a moment to speak directly to all of you about where we\u2019ve been, where we are today, and where we\u2019re going next.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]First, I want to acknowledge something we\u2019ve been open about since launch: [b]September 1 didn\u2019t go the way we wanted it to.[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]Too many of you encountered bugs, crashes, progression issues and other problems that got in the way of the experience we wanted you to have. We know that was frustrating, and I want to personally thank everyone who\u2019s been sticking with us while we worked to make things right.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p][b]At the same time, it\u2019s meant a lot to us to see so many of you enjoying your time in Gildenarch.[\/b] We\u2019ve watched you explore the city, take on its bosses, jump into co-op with friends, uncover its secrets and share your experiences with us. Amidst the issues we\u2019ve been working through, seeing people having fun with Crimson Moon has been a real source of motivation for the entire team.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]And I\u2019m proud of how [b]Team Metal has responded to the challenges we\u2019ve faced since launch[\/b]. The team has been working hard to investigate issues, respond to your reports and get fixes into your hands as quickly as possible.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]In our first month, we\u2019ve released [b]1.0.0.1, Hotfix 1.0.1 and Hotfix 1.0.2[\/b], addressing hundreds of issues across saves and progression, crashes and stability, co-op, combat, camera, run-blocking issues and much more.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]The bug reports, feedback, and detailed explanations you\u2019ve sent us have been invaluable. You\u2019ve told us what isn\u2019t working, what could be better and, just as importantly, what you love about Crimson Moon.\u00a0[\/p][p]And we're not finished.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p][b]Patch 1.1 is next[\/b], with more fixes and quality-of-life improvements informed by the feedback you\u2019ve shared with us. There is still work to do, and we\u2019ll continue listening and improving the game.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]But as we move into October, you\u2019re also going to start hearing us talk about something we haven't been able to focus on nearly as much during our first month - [b]What\u2019s next for Crimson Moon?[\/b][\/p][p][\/p][p]September was about fixing and stabilising the core experience. Now, alongside continuing that work, we\u2019re starting to look further ahead.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]Beyond Patch 1.1, there\u2019s more coming to Gildenarch, including new content, and over the coming weeks we\u2019ll begin peeling back the curtain on what we\u2019ve been working on. For now, here\u2019s a little work-in-progress tease of what\u2019s to come...\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/45986190\/6152486bde322df13b691c1188a3fca80c00398c.jpg\"][\/img][\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/45986190\/6fa5d4fa6218e4c13bfe8f658df4aa350c0f5c94.jpg\"][\/img][\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/45986190\/f7a4bde161ec2769051bff6a8e3ea80d6fa9ae10.jpg\"][\/img][\/p][p]If you\u2019ve stuck with us through this first month, thank you. I\u2019m incredibly proud of this team, grateful for the community that has formed around Crimson Moon, and excited to finally start showing you more of what we have planned.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]We\u2019ll see you in Gildenarch.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]Dave Lesperance\u00a0[\/p][p]General Manager, Team Metal\u00a0[\/p]","commentcount":37,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1890460210_1790972078_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"586187435308973181","event_gid":"713414124781962475","voteupcount":337,"votedowncount":8,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"586187435308973181","rtime32_last_modified":1793306323,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1790972078,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1790969147,"votes_up":337,"votes_down":8,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"565911090118065486","gidfeature2":"586187435308973181"},{"gid":"713414124781961297","clan_steamid":"103582791475507598","event_name":"Crimson Moon Hotfix 1.0.2 is Now Live!","event_type":28,"appid":4317690,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1790781060,"rtime32_end_time":1790784660,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"Check out the full patch notes below\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"3ff5c02c94ca050a0fa67589c6137d6f981d06c2.jpg\",\"3ff5c02c94ca050a0fa67589c6137d6f981d06c2.jpg\",\"e5bb256f3a607298b01390dc13eee5683ac2f9a1.jpg\",\"92c22b4637042b2b2c364dd37f5f2a01a320b160.jpg\",null,null,\"bd1a316267f9e016640ad399a7e16d9e67a658f7.jpg\",null,null,null,\"6fc789e2a8b649d44cc964575a9e88b3e17baffd.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"00401d95ac8269866a9576f390a58ac4fecfea37.jpg\",null,null,null,null,\"3ff5c02c94ca050a0fa67589c6137d6f981d06c2.jpg\",null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"0815bc2560599643a14a24a10a18bd0b2d095f90.jpg\",\"68796daa8a0c12b7d22dc1f62a46c5b9a9a3fcb0.jpg\",\"ea251663e2a42a5f8c0cce02352a43a402326c2d.jpg\",\"a1e29f99aea7641fde9687ce64adaec612e35f73.jpg\",null,null,\"ad8a7725a9e446475115533fff63f76328e240be.jpg\",null,null,null,\"1be9709fb59653bdea8ba80b4edac3fcc5d51f11.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"7a8870afa900b20c6893f410500fb2b937f67b60.jpg\",null,null,null,null,\"572f8f04dfd87dd1bee1565a73959660e68e714b.jpg\",null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"library_spotlight\":true,\"rt_migrated_time\":1791205918.374}","announcement_body":{"gid":"713414124781961298","clanid":"45986190","posterid":"0","headline":"Crimson Moon Hotfix 1.0.2 is Now Live!","posttime":1790781120,"updatetime":1791470678,"body":"[p]Hey Nephilim,\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p][b]Hotfix 1.0.2 is now live on all platforms![\/b]\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]Team Metal has been hard at work addressing as many of the issues reported by players as possible. This is our biggest update yet, with hundreds of fixes and improvements across [b]saves and progression, co-op, combat, Boons and Weapon Arts, crashes, performance, camera and much more.[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]Thank you to everyone who has continued to report issues and share feedback with us. Your reports continue to help the team identify, reproduce and prioritise issues, and many of the fixes included below directly address issues raised by the community.\u00a0[\/p][p]\u00a0[\/p][h3][b]Key Fixes in Patch 1.0.2[\/b]\u00a0[\/h3][p][\/p][p]There\u2019s a lot in this update. Here are just some of the highlights:\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][list][*][p][b]Major co-op fixes[\/b], including issues with Quickplay, joining games, progression, dealing damage and parrying, alongside several issues that could leave players stuck or unable to continue.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][\/*][*][p][b]More save and progression fixes[\/b], including issues where progress and unlock information could incorrectly carry between different save files, alongside improvements to make overwriting saves safer.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Lore Scrolls can now be collected in co-op[\/b], fixing an issue that could prevent the second player from collecting them and progressing related quests.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Clear the Area objectives should now be more reliable[\/b], with fixes for enemies that could fail to spawn or make their way towards you, preventing you from completing the objective.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed numerous locations where players could [b]become stuck in the environment or fall through the world[\/b].\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Lots of fixes for Boons and Weapon Arts[\/b], including Angelic Bulwark, Brewmaster, Aftershock Technique, Avenging Pestilence, Shield of Many, Pyromancer, Impaling Throw and more.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Improved the downed and revive experience in co-op[\/b], fixing several issues that could occur while players were downed or being revived.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][\/*][*][p][b]More crash and performance fixes across PC and consoles[\/b], including improvements across multiple levels and boss encounters.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Steam Deck improvements[\/b], including fixes for controls, UI readability, combat desync and performance.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][\/*][*][p][b]More camera and lock-on fixes[\/b], including issues during rolling attacks and encounters with Egregore and Demon Brute.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Clearer Status Effect information[\/b] for Rage, Poisoned, Freeze, Marked and Sundered.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Improved loot and Gold pickups[\/b], including a fix for dropped items bunching together and a new setting that allows you to auto-pickup Gold!\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][\/*][*][p]Plus [b]many more fixes across quests, UI, localisation, audio, cinematics, enemies, bosses and the world itself.[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\u00a0[\/p][h3][b]An Update on Saves & Progression[\/b]\u00a0[\/h3][p][\/p][p]We know [b]save and progression loss has been one of the biggest concerns for players[\/b], and it continues to be one of our highest priorities.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]Hotfix 1.0.2 includes [b]a number of important save fixes designed to make saves more stable and secure[\/b], addressing several of the issues we\u2019ve identified through player reports and our ongoing investigation.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]While we expect these changes to make a meaningful improvement to save stability, our work here isn\u2019t finished. [b]A few of the remaining save issues are more complex, and for Patch 1.1 we\u2019re planning a more substantial rework of how saves are handled.[\/b] This is a larger piece of work that requires additional development and testing, but will allow us to fix the underlying issues and better protect your saves going forward.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p][b]Many of the remaining save issues we\u2019re investigating occur when moving between devices[\/b], so in the meantime, we recommend playing Crimson Moon on a single device where possible. Until we can confirm these issues are fully resolved, we recommend avoiding switching devices when playing the same save.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]For players on PC, you may also want to [b]create a local backup of your save as an additional precaution[\/b] while we continue this work.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]We know this isn\u2019t an ideal recommendation, but we want to be transparent about the current situation while also making clear that [b]1.0.2 contains meaningful improvements to save stability[\/b]. Please continue reporting any save or progression issues you experience after updating - your reports are incredibly valuable as we continue this work.\u00a0[\/p][p]\u00a0[\/p][h3][b]What\u2019s Next[\/b]\u00a0[\/h3][p][\/p][p]Hotfix 1.0.2 is another substantial step forward for Crimson Moon, but [b]our work doesn\u2019t stop here[\/b].\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]Our next major update, [b]Patch 1.1, is planned for October[\/b]. Alongside the wider work on saves outlined above, 1.1 will focus on further quality-of-life improvements, including [b]gear and Blacksmith improvements, clearer gear and Boon information, better visibility of run progression, rewards and unlocks, further control remapping improvements, and additional co-op improvements.[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]And while our focus since launch has understandably been on [b]fixing and improving the core experience[\/b], we\u2019re also looking further ahead.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p][b]There\u2019s more coming to Crimson Moon.[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]As we move into October, we\u2019ll begin sharing more about [b]new content coming to the game and what\u2019s next for Gildenarch[\/b]. We\u2019re not quite ready to reveal everything just yet, but you won\u2019t have to wait too much longer to find out more.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]For now, there are a lot more fixes to dig into below.\u00a0[\/p][p]\u00a0[\/p][h3][b]Full Patch Notes[\/b]\u00a0[\/h3][p][\/p][p][b]Crashes & Stability[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where dying a True Death could fail to transition the player to the Mission Results screen.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a co-op client could crash when drinking a Health Flask during the Cardinal Mathias boss fight.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed multiple crashes affecting PC.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed multiple crashes affecting Xbox Series X|S.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a crash affecting PS5.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an Xbox Series X|S hang that could occur during rendering.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an animation-related crash on PC.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a crash that could occur while processing UI text.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a player could fail to revive correctly if a cinematic began while they were downed.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a player could fall through the world after a death cinematic while waiting to respawn.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\u00a0[\/p][p][b]Save Data & Progression[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where Boons and Loadout Egg status from an active run could incorrectly carry over into a new save file.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed consumable unlock status carrying over between different save files.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Save Overwrite confirmation screen not identifying which save would be overwritten.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Changed the default selection on the Save Overwrite confirmation screen from \u201cYes\u201d to the safer \u201cNo.\u201d\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue with save-file timestamps displaying an incorrect time.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where progression information could display incorrectly when starting a new save.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where the game could continue running behind a system save prompt.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where Xbox players could repeatedly receive a [b]\u201cSave upload failed\u201d[\/b] warning between levels or while in the Hub.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\u00a0[\/p][p][b]Multiplayer & Co-op[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where [b]Quickplay was not working correctly[\/b].\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where players received a \u201cGame Not Open to Join\u201d error when attempting to join online sessions.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where crossplay friend requests between Xbox and other platforms were not being received.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where Epic Games Store players could fail to see in-game multiplayer invitations.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a co-op client could incorrectly inherit the host\u2019s mission progress.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where previously obtained level-up rewards could re-display for a co-op client after the host ended the session.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a co-op client could return to their own Hub or run with the base Crimson Oath gear instead of their previously equipped gear.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where players could join a co-op session while the host was already mid-run.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a co-op client could sometimes be unable to see the host\u2019s attack animations.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a co-op client could deal reduced damage to enemies until dying and being revived.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a co-op client could lose the ability to parry with a two-handed weapon after repeatedly swapping weapons.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a co-op client might not properly enter Angel Mode when activating it while taking damage.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a co-op client could enter an incorrect standing state while downed.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a co-op client lost control of their character when the host entered the Felwyl boss arena.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a co-op client was blocked from rejoining the final boss fight by red mist at the arena entrance.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a co-op client could host another session while already connected to an existing session.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where players could become stuck in the Hub after joining and leaving a multiplayer session without first selecting a Loadout.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a dead player\u2019s collision could remain behind in co-op and block movement.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where the host could not control the spectator camera when the co-op client had an enemy locked on.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed spectator view having no audio when both players were downed and the client reached Final Death.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where the low-health screen effect could appear for the host when the co-op client was the player at low health.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where enemy death visual effects did not appear for co-op clients.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where the Avenging Pestilence aura appeared incorrectly oversized to co-op clients.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where picking up one emergent Quest item could count twice towards Quest progress in multiplayer.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue preventing co-op clients from collecting Lore Scrolls and progressing related Lore Scroll Quests.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where players could become stuck between an elevator and wall in Archspire Cathedral during co-op.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a co-op player could briefly face the wrong direction during General Valahk\u2019s introduction.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a co-op client could appear to float during an Ancient Chamber introduction cinematic.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where the multiplayer Friends menu Block button did not function.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where using a controller on PC did not bring up the virtual keyboard when entering a multiplayer invite code.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\u00a0[\/p][p][b]UI & HUD[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where one of the Life icons on the player\u2019s HUD appeared yellow instead of the correct colour.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed multiple Life icons incorrectly displaying the final-life state.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed inconsistent terminology in the inventory between \u201cStash\u201d and \u201cReserved Items.\u201d\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where Ascendant Aura did not appear in the active Boon list while active.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Armory upgrade screen displaying an \u201cEpic\u201d label when an item was already at maximum upgrade.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed items in the Blacksmith menu being inconsistently greyed out.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Boss Weapon Side Quests appearing in both the Active and Completed Quest tabs.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Improved the readability of Boon description text.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a stale health bar remaining visible for an extended period.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Stamina value in the Equipment menu displaying as a decimal.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the purchase button requiring an unusually long mouse hold to activate.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the \u201cMax Upgrade\u201d banner appearing on items that had not reached their maximum upgrade level.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a Revive prompt appearing on the downed player\u2019s own screen.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed throwable ammunition displaying the wrong equipped item on the HUD.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the final boss Mission Results screen incorrectly displaying \u201cMission 1.\u201d\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Side Quest icons appearing as Main Quest icons on the Hub compass.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the \u201cEquipped\u201d banner appearing on every item in the Upgrade screen instead of only the equipped item.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the District Complete screen displaying an incorrect value for players at the level cap.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Epoch Cuirass\u2019s Aftershock Boon not appearing in its item information or Boon list.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Poison status meter on the HUD not depleting over time.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed throwable ammunition pickups not displaying the amount of ammunition being added.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed already-owned Merchant items incorrectly displaying a \u201cNew\u201d ribbon.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed completing a Boss Weapon Quest not displaying the acquired weapon notification.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Stamina bar appearing incorrectly when loading into a level with depleted Stamina.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Quest goal text being cut off in Windowed Mode.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Blacksmith Upgrade Armory scrollbar disappearing after visiting the Upgrade Equipment submenu.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed overlapping text on the Mission Summary screen.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Settings button icons being cut off at certain resolutions when using a controller.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Skip Dialogue button scaling incorrectly.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Librarian Mereda\u2019s Boons not displaying an \u201cInsufficient Souls\u201d tooltip when the player could not afford them.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed rapidly closing a Lore Scroll causing it to remain open.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Boons purchased from Librarian Mereda not displaying their cost.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Boon description pop-ups failing to appear for subsequent purchases.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Improved Boon descriptions for [b]Rage, Poisoned, Freeze, Marked and Sundered[\/b].\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Improved shop sorting so locked items are ordered from lowest to highest unlock level.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Improved the overall visual polish of the Blacksmith UI and Boon purchase UI.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed NPC shop menus appearing before NPC dialogue had finished.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Blacksmith comparison view not displaying by default.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed status-effect explanations appearing while looting instead of only when inspecting items in menus.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Angelic Bulwark information displayed in the Boons menu.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed missing Weapon Art keywords from Fiery Broadsword.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue preventing players from switching tabs in the Purified Items menu.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed difficulty skulls becoming misaligned on the Reward screen when using a non-default UI scale.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed extra spacing in the Throwing Knife and Aegis descriptions.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an inconsistency in the visual style of the level-up number displayed on the End of Run screen.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Added XP rewards to Quest Log entries alongside other rewards such as Gold.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Improved the distinction between [b]fixed and non-fixed Boons on equipment[\/b].\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Nexus Gate opening lacking sufficient visual clarity.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the starting sword lacking its proper name.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where Boon Gate plates could fail to appear.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a typo in the Aegis Ascendance upgrade notification.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed button and key icons being cut off in some shop menus.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed multiple additional UI presentation and layout issues.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\u00a0[\/p][p][b]Camera[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p]Fixed the camera not smoothly following the player during rolling attacks.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the camera clipping through the wall at the top of the Archspire Cathedral Archive elevator.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed locking onto Egregore\u2019s weak points not properly focusing the camera on those targets.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the lock-on camera moving erratically or clipping below the ground during the Demon Brute boss fight in the Prologue.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the camera clipping through the floor when a boss jumped over the player.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the camera facing the wrong direction when moving past Egregore\u2019s cores or weak points while locked on.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a camera hitch that could occur during gameplay.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed enemies, NPCs and other players remaining visible when the camera moved very close to them.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Improved the transition back to mouse sensitivity when exiting lock-on.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\u00a0[\/p][p][b]Key Bindings & Controls[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p]Fixed Prologue tutorial tooltips not reflecting the player\u2019s custom key bindings.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where the key remap screen could not be exited when using a controller.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Mouse Buttons 4 and 5 not being represented correctly in the keybindings menu.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue with the keyboard and mouse rebind confirmation screen.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Improved the precision available when adjusting mouse sensitivity.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Added a mouse sensitivity slider to the Settings menu.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\u00a0[\/p][p][b]Enemies & Combat[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p]Fixed additional enemies failing to spawn when the player was close to completing a Clear the Area objective.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed enemies failing to navigate towards the player when a Clear the Area objective was nearly complete.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a Skeleton Warrior in Forsaken Streets being positioned in an out-of-the-way location that frequently prevented completion of kill objectives.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a Clear All Enemies objective could complete without the final enemy being defeated.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a Captain enemy becoming stuck in an animation loop.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed General Valahk\u2019s sword buff VFX briefly covering the entire weapon.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed attacking certain enemies with an unparryable status causing the player\u2019s own attacks to be parried.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Cardinal Mathias\u2019s staff remaining completely static during the fight.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Knight Terror missing a visual invulnerability indicator during its AOE Hellgrowth rupture attack.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Egregore occasionally becoming invisible.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Knight Terror\u2019s forward AOE triggering after the enemy had been staggered.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a specific issue where parrying the Demon Brute\u2019s fist slam could fail to deal poise damage or trigger a parry reaction.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed General Valahk\u2019s fire projectiles displaying without the correct textures.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed General Valahk\u2019s projectiles unexpectedly redirecting towards the player mid-flight.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Felwyl Ascended not applying Poison to players.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed status effects sometimes failing to apply correctly to Felwyl.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where Mahkteah could stop dealing damage, and Burning could heal the player instead of damaging them.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Spear Cultists not rewarding Souls when killed.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed inconsistent enemy attack behaviour when enemies were positioned on stairs or ramps.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed two armour pieces unintentionally granting immunity to Fire damage.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Undead Brute\u2019s AOE pommel stomp failing to damage players standing within its affected area.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a Demon Brute in Archspire Cathedral becoming stuck on geometry while moving towards the player.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an enemy spawning outside the playable area in Ramshorn Keep.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Bosses now display a red invulnerability effect during phase transitions to make it clearer when they cannot be damaged.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Added controller vibration feedback for Cardinal Mathias\u2019s powered-up AOE attack.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\u00a0[\/p][p][b]Boons & Weapon Arts[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p]Fixed Angelic Bulwark\u2019s shield not functioning.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Brewmaster frequently not being applied after opening Nexus Gates.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue affecting Brewmaster\u2019s stacking behaviour.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Aftershock Technique disappearing after swapping equipment under certain conditions.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Avenging Pestilence being cancellable mid-cast to Poison enemies without consuming Mana.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Avenging Pestilence causing the player\u2019s attacks to deal damage twice.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Avenging Pestilence\u2019s aura visual effect disappearing abruptly when the effect ended.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Shield of Many failing to knock enemies back following a successful parry.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Pyromancer combined with Aftershock Technique causing all damage types to incorrectly apply Burn.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Impaling Throw causing subsequent normal attacks to incorrectly inherit Weapon Art damage bonuses.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Impaling Throw spawning unintended white orbs on impact.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Impaling Throw missing targets at close range.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Ground Slam Weapon Arts hitting enemies twice without Aftershock Technique equipped.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed terrain-based Weapon Arts clipping into stairs when used facing uphill.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Empower replaying its activation audio and visual effects when equipping an item while already active.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Boon sigils sometimes being invisible while their lighting and visual effects remained visible.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\u00a0[\/p][p][b]World & Items[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p]Fixed multiple locations across Elk Grove Academy, Ramshorn Keep, Archspire Cathedral, Forsaken Streets and other areas where players could become permanently stuck in Hellgrowth or world geometry.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed multiple areas where players could fall through the world.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where executions performed near geometry could rarely leave the player stuck in terrain.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed missing collision on Hellgrowth near both Nexus Gates in Elk Grove Academy.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed rocks in Elk Grove Academy having no collision.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an out-of-bounds exploit involving a climbable cliffside in Elk Grove Academy.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed invisible collision barriers blocking player movement.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a gap in Archspire Cathedral that allowed players to fall out of bounds.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed several locations in Archspire Cathedral where players could become stuck between environmental objects.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed several locations in Ramshorn Keep where players could become trapped behind Hellgrowth or other geometry.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed several locations in Forsaken Streets where collision could trap or obstruct players.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a player could become stuck on candle stands after performing a Heavy Attack.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where a player could become stuck behind a spike barrier in Wall Tower.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where players could climb environmental objects and fall into inaccessible gaps.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a loot drop spawning inside a bookcase in Archspire Cathedral.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a loot drop landing inside a Hellgrowth Flower and becoming unrecoverable.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a location in Forsaken Streets where dropped loot could not be retrieved.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a golden chest glow appearing where no chest existed.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed ground geometry clipping through a building wall in Forsaken Streets.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed missing ground textures in the Ancient Chamber before the Mahkteah encounter.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where [b]loot drops could pile up or bunch together after killing an enemy[\/b].\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Gold coins not being collected immediately when walking over them.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Added an option to [b]disable Auto-Gold Pickup[\/b].\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Elite enemies occasionally dropping no items when defeated.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Immolation Bomb being unavailable in the world and from Merchants.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Immolation Elixir description incorrectly stating that it continuously applied Burn.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed visual popping on the Ram Cuirass cape during the player\u2019s run animation.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Monks in the Main Menu and Hub occasionally appearing without their legs.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a character\u2019s legs disappearing during a Brute execution.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Solomon Statue voice lines can now be replayed after the initial interaction.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed equipment racks clipping into the environment in the Hub.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed several additional missing or incorrect collision areas.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed several additional environment seams, gaps and visual issues.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed several instances of objects appearing incorrectly or clipping into the environment.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\u00a0[\/p][p][b]Progression, Equipment & Unlocks[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p]Fixed upgrading a shield not correctly increasing its stats, and added small stat bonuses to shields.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed upgrading a holstered weapon swapping its Weapon Arts with those of the currently equipped weapon.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed upgrading the currently held weapon swapping it with the off-hand weapon.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where equipment could lose its Boons when upgraded.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Relic Quest issues preventing them from functioning correctly.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Relics dropping below the world when the player died while carrying them.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed players being able to purchase the same equipment from the Blacksmith again after upgrading it.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed multiple Blacksmith and Merchant unlock rewards having no effect.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Gallant\u2019s Quest Board missing Bounty Quests.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Boss Weapon Quests disappearing from Completed Quests after restarting the game.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Gildenarch\u2019s Glory appearing in a new save before it should be accessible.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Abraxas Stone acquisition cutscene repeating after subsequent boss clears.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Trinket Slot 2 unlock not functioning correctly.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed players not spawning with their additional Potions when starting a new level.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Prologue Polearm remaining in the inventory after completing the first-time tutorial.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Hardening Elixirs appearing in the Warden\u2019s arena before being unlocked.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Mission Gate opening before the player selected their Loadout.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the host occasionally spawning inside the Portal Room floor after selecting a Loadout.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Librarian Mereda\u2019s Boon platforms appearing incorrectly.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the AXIOM sword missing its Weapon Trail VFX.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Status Flask pickups all displaying the Flaming Rebuke model.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed flickering Fire VFX in the Hub.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed visual skinning errors on the Crimson Oath Armour set.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where the Gallant interface could close unexpectedly.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue affecting Gajov\u2019s equipment upgrade selection.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed issues with equipment positioning on the Sword of Rot and Crescent Halberd.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\u00a0[\/p][p][b]Audio[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p]Fixed the Warden\u2019s short Poison Slam attack sometimes lacking audio.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed controller rumble occurring while navigating equipment in the Blacksmith and Merchant menus.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed controller vibration continuing during loading after selecting \u201cEnd Session.\u201d\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Reduced excessively intense controller rumble on Xbox.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a looping sound effect during the Felwyl encounter in Moore Manor.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Empower\u2019s activation sound replaying incorrectly when equipping an item while Empower was active.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Portal ambience responding to the incorrect volume setting.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Felwyl the Withered\u2019s dialogue responding to the incorrect volume setting.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed General Valahk dialogue overlapping his second-phase cinematic.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Increased boss music volume.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Reduced weapon impact sound volume.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\u00a0[\/p][p][b]Performance[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p]Improved shader compilation on game launch, reducing the time required and improving load times.[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed framerate drops during the Dry Rot King\u2019s phase cinematics and second-phase animations.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed framerate drops and hitching during traversal and combat in Forsaken Streets.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed framerate drops during the Warden introduction and boss fight.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed framerate drops during the Tyrigon and Egregore boss fights.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed framerate drops and hitching throughout Ramshorn Keep and Elk Grove Academy.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed framerate drops during General Valahk\u2019s second-phase cutscene.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed framerate dropping to approximately 20 FPS in a specific area of Archspire Cathedral on Xbox Series S.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed significant framerate drops and hitching when attacking the Fire Mage during the Prologue tutorial.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed framerate drops during the Prologue Spire Blast cinematic and later areas of the Prologue.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a noticeable hitch when opening the Equipment menu.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an FPS drop when moving the camera close to a loot drop while swapping items.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a performance drop when looking towards the Spire.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a collision-related performance spike on PS5.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Improved the default Steam Deck performance configuration.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Performed multiple optimisation passes across HUD widgets, UI layouts, audio references and level rendering to reduce overhead and improve frame consistency.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Armour loot is now loaded asynchronously when equipped from a drop, reducing hitches.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\u00a0[\/p][p][b]Store & Entitlements[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p]Fixed Deluxe Edition gear remaining visually equipped after entitlements were removed during Loadout selection.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed removing Deluxe Edition entitlements while Axe of the Gods was equipped causing an incorrect Weapon Art to load.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the minimum and recommended PC specifications being inconsistent between Steam and Epic Games Store.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed inaccurate disk-space requirements being displayed before installation.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the \u201cGreat Soul Reclaimer\u201d achievement being awarded earlier than intended on Steam and Epic Games Store.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Crimson Moon soundtrack listing on Steam missing artwork.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed premium armour-set unlocks tied to marketing entitlements not displaying correctly.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\u00a0[\/p][p][b]Steam Deck[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p]Fixed Steam Deck clients frequently desyncing during combat.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the host seeing a Steam Deck client\u2019s character animations display at a low framerate.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed gameplay streamed from Steam Deck to PC appearing noticeably dim.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the on-screen keyboard failing to appear on the co-op Join Code screen in Desktop Mode.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a brief white rectangle appearing when changing display resolution.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed multiple Steam Deck settings not functioning as intended.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed switching between docked and undocked mode causing inputs to jitter or repeatedly fail.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the on-screen keyboard not appearing when opening the Redeem Menu from the Main Menu.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the \u201cGreat Soul Reclaimer\u201d achievement not being awarded on Steam Deck.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Improved Steam Deck performance when using the default graphics configuration.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed multiple [b]Steam Deck UI readability issues[\/b], including missing or incorrectly sized button glyphs and difficult-to-read text.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\u00a0[\/p][p][b]Tutorials & First-Time Experience[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p]Fixed tutorial videos failing to appear in tutorial pop-ups.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Prologue tutorial prompts not displaying customised key bindings.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Improved tutorial messaging around inventory bag slots.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Added additional messaging around the Felwyl encounter.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed an issue with a Felwyl tutorial image.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the loading video displaying incorrectly during part of its animation.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\u00a0[\/p][p][b]VO, Narrative & Localisation[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p]Fixed Lotte\u2019s voice line not playing when turning in \u201cOld Habits.\u201d\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed post-death boss dialogue being cut short by the Results screen.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Felwyl\u2019s defeated dialogue being cut off.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Gallant\u2019s introductory Quest dialogue being cut short.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the Locket Merchant Side Quest dialogue ending prematurely.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed dialogue overlapping after ascending the Clocktower Elevator in Forsaken Streets.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed multiple subtitle typos.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed the \u201cRemnants of Akyreon\u201d Quest name being misspelled in the Quest Log.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed duplicate text in the \u201cAegoroth, I Am Ready\u201d Lore Scroll.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed German word-wrapping issues in \u201cThe Prophecy.\u201d\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed mistranslated words in the Spanish localisation.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Lotte delivering post-mission dialogue about Quests the player had not completed.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed a Gajov Quest ending before its dialogue had finished.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed multiple errors in the \u201cGarrison Rumor\u201d Lore Scroll.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed punctuation errors in the \u201cFirst Communion\u201d Lore Scroll.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed Chinese localisation not appearing for the Angel Mode input action.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed multiple additional Lore Scroll, subtitle and localisation errors.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\u00a0[\/p][p][b]Additional Fixes & Polish[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p]Fixed several missing or incorrect visual effects across characters, equipment, Boons and environments.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed multiple visual issues affecting environmental props and objects.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed several cases of environmental assets appearing incorrectly at different graphics settings.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed several UI assets and text elements displaying incorrectly at different resolutions or UI scales.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed several additional issues affecting Quest, reward and progression presentation.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p]Fixed multiple credits omissions and spelling errors.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list]","commentcount":30,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1607812438_1790782237_0","ModAct_1787316731_1790893243_4","ModAct_1889321037_1791206211_4","ModAct_1847323374_1791474617_4"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"586187435308792389","event_gid":"713414124781961297","voteupcount":266,"votedowncount":5,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":1790781060,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"586187435308792389","rtime32_last_modified":1793130972,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1791474618,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1790771268,"votes_up":266,"votes_down":5,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"565911090118065486","gidfeature2":"586187435308792389"},{"gid":"693145389614760650","clan_steamid":"103582791475507598","event_name":"Crimson Moon Patch 1.0.0.1","event_type":12,"appid":4317690,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1788454980,"rtime32_end_time":1788460201,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"14dc86eb4d9814963f455b184f5a93adc573f354.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"73e72e456216152ec64bc6a91e366f71d768db6b.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"library_spotlight\":false}","announcement_body":{"gid":"693145389614760651","clanid":"45986190","posterid":"0","headline":"Crimson Moon Patch 1.0.0.1","posttime":1788455017,"updatetime":1789136545,"body":"[p]Good news, PC Nephilim! \u2328\ufe0f\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]Patch 1.0.0.1 has passed testing and we've decided to put our Alpha implementation of keybinding support into your hands now, rather than make you wait for the full, polished version.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]The update is available now (version 162350), giving PC players basic keyboard & mouse remapping and mouse sensitivity controls while we continue to refine and expand the feature.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/45986190\/1a24172121b03292dd43a29c9809456697ca27cd.jpg\"][\/img][\/p][p]Keybinding support was already planned for PC, but we chose to hold the initial implementation at launch while we resolved some remaining issues. Your feedback reinforced that getting these options into your hands should be a priority, so the team has been working to get them ready as quickly as possible.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p][b]IMPORTANT NOTE: [\/b]this is our first Alpha implementation of keybinding support, not the final, polished experience we intend to deliver. You can find this new feature under the Settings Menu > Keyboard > select the custom keyboard profile (click the left arrow).\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/45986190\/29711306af436116bfcc73df51f663c5e7b152e0.png\"][\/img][\/p][p]Right now, you can rebind all available actions, revert bindings to their defaults and adjust mouse sensitivity, but there are some things [b]not included[\/b] in this version that we're working to add in a future update \u2013 these include:\u00a0[\/p][list][*][p][b]Multiple bindings[\/b] - assign more than one key to the same action\u00a0\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p][b]Double-tap inputs[\/b] - assign actions to quickly pressing a key twice\u00a0\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][list][*][p][b]Hold inputs[\/b] - assign actions to holding a key down\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]We made the decision to get this Alpha functionality into your hands sooner rather than make you wait for the full implementation. [b]This is only our first step, and we want your feedback to help us refine what comes next and what's important to you.[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]Please let us know what works, what doesn\u2019t, and any issues you encounter. [b]We\u2019d also love to hear what additional keybinding options or functionality you\u2019d like to see in the next implementation.[\/b]\u00a0[\/p][p]We\u2019ll continue refining and expanding keybinding support in future updates.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][h2][b]What's Next?[\/b]\u00a0[\/h2][p][\/p][p]Our attention is also firmly on the other pressing issues players have raised since launch, including camera improvements, progression loss, UI scaling settings and improvements, game crashes & additional controller layout options.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p]The team is actively working through these now, and we\u2019ll have more to share on the next patch soon.\u00a0[\/p][p][\/p][p][b]We won\u2019t keep you waiting long \u2694\ufe0f[\/b]\u00a0[\/p]","commentcount":115,"tags":["patchnotes","mod_reviewed","ModAct_1607812438_1788456387_0","ModAct_1878895840_1788466332_4","ModAct_1878895840_1788471532_4","ModAct_1890460210_1788990484_4","ModAct_487176015_1789075624_4","ModAct_487176015_1789077318_4","ModAct_1847323374_1789137023_4"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"582807198746450457","event_gid":"693145389614760650","voteupcount":812,"votedowncount":21,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"582807198746450457","rtime32_last_modified":1791213731,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1789137023,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":25091239,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1788454559,"votes_up":812,"votes_down":21,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"565911090118065486","gidfeature2":"582807198746450457"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["713414124781962476","713414124781961298"],"last_update_event":{"rtime":1788454980,"event_gid":"693145389614760650","announcement_gid":"693145389614760651","clan_account_id":45986190}}};
						</script>
					

